---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: contract not paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supply: tokens not supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_settled: tokens supplied
    q_check_settled --> q_revert_settled: position.hasSettled == true
    q_revert_settled --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_check_settled --> q_verify_proof: position.hasSettled == false
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: Merkle proof invalid
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_verify_proof --> q_check_vesting: proof valid, decode allocation
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vestingDuration > 0
    q_check_vesting --> q_direct_transfer: vestingDuration == 0
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_vesting: deploy LegionLinearVesting clone
    q_transfer_vesting --> q_set_settled: transfer tokens to vesting contract
    q_direct_transfer --> q_set_settled: transfer tokens directly to investor
    q_set_settled --> [*]: position.hasSettled = true, emit TokensClaimed

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: Merkle proof verifies allocation amount and terms
        INV-002: allocation determined by project during application processing
    end note
